# Cloudflare Pages serves every emitted `<route>.html` at its extensionless
# path natively (HTML handling), so no rewrite rules are needed for the page
# shells. Rewriting them here caused self-redirects in the emulator and sent
# /admin to /. Anything without a matching shell falls through to 404.html
# and keeps a real 404 status.
/admin/ /admin 301
